          "`groundcover=` entries.",
          "Unknown `key=value` lines are kept as generic settings and written back.",
          "Comments are kept with the setting that follows them and written back.",
          "Typed `fallback=` settings, with `set_game_setting` taking the line's text.",
          "`root_config_file`, `root_config_dir` and `user_config`, and presence helpers for content files and archives.",
          "`ConfigError`, one error type for the whole crate."
        ],
        "fixed": [
          "The key is `user-data`, not `userdata`.",
          "Content files added at runtime are attributed to the user's `openmw.cfg`, not its directory.",
          "Singleton settings read their last definition.",
          "Symlinked configs no longer fail to load."
